{"id":"n73255-1-9","stage":2,"title":"흥미 · 兴趣","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73255-1-9-1","ko":"지수야, 너는 여가 시간에 주로 뭘 해?","zh":"智秀，你闲暇时主要做些什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여가","meaning":"空闲，余暇","explanation":"여가：空闲，余暇","readings":[{"term":"여가","audio":"/audio/3dc88a68357f52cbf97f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15168","senseId":"1","lemma":"여가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간에","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주로","meaning":"主要","explanation":"주로：主要","readings":[{"term":"주로","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91767","senseId":"1","lemma":"주로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"3dc88a68357f52cb","term":"여가","zh":"空闲，余暇","audio":"/audio/3dc88a68357f52cbf97f.mp3","entryId":"15168","definition":"不工作的时间；或指工作时的闲暇时间。","pronunciation":["여가"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"082e27671571beef","term":"주로","zh":"主要","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3","entryId":"91767","definition":"成为基本或重心地。","pronunciation":["주로"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6e2fa78c2e883d736a4e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73255-1-9-2","ko":"요즘 한창 게임에 흥미를 붙이고 있어.","zh":"最近我正对游戏越来越感兴趣。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한창","meaning":"正旺，正盛，正是时候","explanation":"한창：正旺，正盛，正是时候","readings":[{"term":"한창","audio":"/audio/70d63477a23d3b8c1e7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89055","senseId":"1","lemma":"한창","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게임에","meaning":"游戏，比赛","explanation":"게임：游戏，比赛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"게임","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57276","senseId":"1","lemma":"게임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흥미를","meaning":"兴趣，兴致，兴味","explanation":"흥미：兴趣，兴致，兴味；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"흥미","audio":"/audio/ebc97471b0d0dde777bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73255","senseId":"1","lemma":"흥미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붙이고","meaning":"产生","explanation":"붙이다：产生；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也